      "text": "Skip to runs\nN\nNorthstar Studio\n\nWORKSPACE\n\nOverview\nRuns\nWorkflows\nPreferences\n\nA local, fictional interface sample. No account or network connection is used.\n\nOperations\n/\nRun workspace\nDEMO CONTROLS\nColor palette\nClear light\nNight console\n\nOPERATIONS / AUTOMATION\n\nRun workspace\n\nReview recent activity, open the run you need, then repeat or remove it with a clear confirmation.\n\nRun workflow\n\nWorkflow Release checks\nEnvironment Preview\nUpdated 06:10 AM\n\nRecent runs\n\n3 runs\n\nRefresh runs\nFind a run\nStatus\nAll statuses\nSucceeded\nFailed\nQueued\nClear filters\nRecent workflow runs and their status\nRUN\tSTATUS\tSTARTED\t\nACTIONS\n\n\ndependency-audit\nRun r-1843 \u00b7 main\n\tQueued\tjust now\t\nView\n\n\nrelease-check\nRun r-1842 \u00b7 main\n\tSucceeded\t14:32 UTC\t\nView\n\n\ndependency-audit\nRun r-1840 \u00b7 main\n\tSucceeded\t13:48 UTC\t\nView\n\nSample data is local to this page. Refresh simulates a request; it does not contact a service.\n\nRuns are up to date. Existing results were retained.\nPreview recoverable error\nActivity\nTODAY\nRelease checks passed\n14:32 UTC \u00b7 main\nOne run needs attention\n14:11 UTC \u00b7 open run r-1841\nDependency audit finished\n13:48 UTC \u00b7 main\nAppearance and motion\n\nPalette, information density, and drawer motion are independent. These controls change this local preview only.\n\nInformation density\nBalanced\nCondensed\nDrawer entrance\nNo animation\nQuiet side slide\nLight elastic\n\nApplies only when opening run details. Reduced-motion preferences always disable it.",
